_atom_site.Cartn_y
_atom_site.Cartn_z
_atom_site.occupancy
_atom_site.B_iso_or_equiv
_atom_site.auth_seq_id
_atom_site.auth_asym_id
ATOM   1 C CA . ALA A 1 1 0.000   0.000 0.000 1.00 95.00 1 A
ATOM   2 C CA . GLY A 1 2 10.000  0.000 0.000 1.00 90.00 2 A
ATOM   3 C CA . LEU A 1 3 100.000 0.000 0.000 1.00 85.00 3 A
ATOM   4 C CA . ASP A 1 4 6.000   0.000 0.000 1.00 92.00 4 A
ATOM   5 P P  . DA  C 3 1 1.500   0.000 0.000 1.00 70.00 1 C
HETATM 6 C C1 . LIG B 2 1 1.000   0.000 0.000 1.00 50.00 1 B
